            Nhận proposal Company Trip phù hợp trong 24h.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mt-10 mb-0 justify-center w-full max-w-xs sm:max-w-none mx-auto not-prose">
          <a href="#form-dang-ky" class="w-full sm:w-auto" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 12px 24px; background: #1e293b; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; border-radius: 12px; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s ease; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.2); gap: 8px;">
              <svg style="width: 20px; height: 20px; flex-shrink: 0;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
